Hi Yen-Ting,

看你的畫面應該是Windows, 建議下載"SOMbrero_1.2.zip" 測試, 另安裝R的套件時, 須安裝其他相依套件, 因此只有一個"SOMbrero_1.2.zip" 是不夠安裝. 該套件須要其他套件, 例: knitr, igraph, ....

https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/SOMbrero/index.html

Version:1.2
Depends:R (≥ 3.1.0), knitr <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/knitr/index.html>, igraph <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/igraph/index.html> (≥ 1.0)
Imports:wordcloud <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/wordcloud/index.html>, scatterplot3d <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/scatterplot3d/index.html>, RColorBrewer <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RColorBrewer/index.html>, shiny <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/shiny/index.html>, grDevices, graphics, stats

可考慮將其他已安裝 SOMbrero 套件A電腦 R\library 目錄的所有資料夾內容複製(不要取代30個基本套件)到沒有網路環境B電腦的R\library 資料夾, 此時B電腦即可使用 SOMbrero 套件.
# end

